<title>INDIA: India LML 96/97 1st half net falls.</title>
<headline>India LML 96/97 1st half net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    101.9  vs    112.8</p>
<p>    Gross Sales	 3,293.7  vs  2,618.1</p>
<p>    Other income	   67.4  vs     47.3</p>
<p>    Expenditure	 3,019.9  vs  2,430.9</p>
<p>    Interest		 83.7  vs     61.8</p>
<p>    Gross profit	  257.5  vs    172.7</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   44.7  vs     59.9</p>
<p>    Tax			15.1  vs	Nil</p>
<p>NOTE: India's LML Ltd said in a statement on Sunday that its capacity expansion from 200,000 to 600,000 vehicles annually was progressing to schedule, along with the diversification of its product range.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
